---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'About Story Daily Tech',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200"
      >
        About Story Daily Tech
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-lg">
        Practical Life & Tech Insights, Mobile Diagnostics, and Real-World Troubleshooting
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <strong>Story Daily Tech</strong> (<a href="https://m.storydailyview.com" class="text-primary hover:underline"
          >m.storydailyview.com</a
        >) is an independent technical publication dedicated to delivering practical tech insights, mobile device
        troubleshooting, and real-world system solutions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We bridge the gap between everyday digital life and technical problem-solving. Rather than abstract theoretical
        overviews, our goal is to provide clear, actionable workflows for mobile environments, hardware stability, and
        daily digital maintenance to help readers resolve technical issues quickly and safely.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
        <li>
          <strong>Mobile & Smart Devices:</strong> Smartphone charging safety, battery management, sensor diagnostics, and
          portable accessory optimization.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Hardware & Storage:</strong> NVMe enclosures, external drive formatting standards (exFAT, NTFS, APFS), and
          data integrity verification.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>System Diagnostics:</strong> Windows and macOS troubleshooting, command-line repair utilities (CHKDSK, SFC,
          DISM), and OS configuration.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Tech Peripherals & Gear:</strong> Mechanical keyboards, ergonomic workspace setups, and display interface
          connectivity.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Practical Life & Tech:</strong> Daily device routines, productivity workflows, and system reliability guides
          for everyday users.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">Editorial Standards</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Every technical workflow and troubleshooting guide published on Story Daily Tech is verified to ensure user
        safety and stability. We prioritize data preservation, reproducible methodologies, and clear, step-by-step
        guidance across all our publications.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
